# Run top to bottom; later requests reuse ids from earlier responses.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Open Elif's wallet
# @name elif
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerName": "Elif Yılmaz", "currency": "TRY" }

### Open Kerem's wallet
# @name kerem
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerName": "Kerem Aydın", "currency": "TRY" }

### Salary deposit: 5.000,00 TRY
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{elif.response.body.$.id}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: maas-2026-11-elif

{ "amountMinor": 500000, "currency": "TRY", "description": "Kasım maaşı" }

### Rent share transfer: 1.750,00 TRY
# @name rent
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: kira-2026-11-elif-kerem

{
  "fromAccountId": "{{elif.response.body.$.id}}",
  "toAccountId": "{{kerem.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amountMinor": 175000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "description": "Kira payı - Kasım"
}

### Same request again: replayed, no second posting (see Idempotent-Replayed header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: kira-2026-11-elif-kerem

{
  "fromAccountId": "{{elif.response.body.$.id}}",
  "toAccountId": "{{kerem.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amountMinor": 175000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "description": "Kira payı - Kasım"
}

### Transfer details
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers/{{rent.response.body.$.id}}

### Kerem withdraws 300,00 TRY
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{kerem.response.body.$.id}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: atm-2026-11-21-kerem

{ "amountMinor": 30000, "currency": "TRY", "description": "ATM çekimi" }

### Overdraft attempt: 422 insufficient-funds
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: fazla-transfer-2026-11-21

{
  "fromAccountId": "{{kerem.response.body.$.id}}",
  "toAccountId": "{{elif.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amountMinor": 9999900,
  "currency": "TRY"
}

### Reverse the rent transfer: 422 here, because Kerem already withdrew part of it
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers/{{rent.response.body.$.id}}/reversal
Idempotency-Key: iade-kira-2026-11

### Elif's statement, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{elif.response.body.$.id}}/entries?limit=10

### Elif's balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{elif.response.body.$.id}}

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
